<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fred Meyer upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fred Meyer upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised its recommendation on Fred Meyer Inc, adding the stock to the firm's priority list from recommended.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/2 to 33-1/4 in morning NYSE trade.</p>
</text>
